@startuml seq-approve
title 管理员审批时序
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor 管理员
participant "待审核列表页" as Page
participant "RegistrationService" as Svc
participant "RegistrationRepository" as RegRepo
participant "ActivityRepository" as ActRepo
participant "CapacityChecker" as Cap
participant "EventBus" as Bus
participant "NotificationObserver" as Notify
participant "MessageRepository" as MsgRepo

管理员 -> Page: 点击「通过」
Page -> Svc: approve(registration_id)
Svc -> RegRepo: get(registration_id)
RegRepo --> Svc: Registration(status=待审核)
Svc -> Svc: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
Svc -> RegRepo: get(registration_id) 重读
RegRepo --> Svc: Registration(status=待审核)
Svc -> ActRepo: get(activity_id)
Svc -> Cap: has_room(activity)
Cap -> RegRepo: count_status(activity_id, 已通过)
RegRepo --> Cap: n
Cap --> Svc: true / false

alt 还有名额
  Svc -> RegRepo: update_status(registration_id, 已通过)
  Svc -> Svc: COMMIT
  Svc -> Bus: publish(RegistrationEvent approved)
  Bus -> Notify: handle(event)
  Notify -> MsgRepo: add(content, dedupe_key)
  Svc --> Page: Result(ok, 已通过)
  Page --> 管理员: 列表刷新，状态变「已通过」
else 名额已满
  Svc -> Svc: ROLLBACK
  Svc --> Page: Result(失败, capacity_full)
  Page --> 管理员: 提示「名额已满，无法通过」
end

note over Svc
  事务内重读并复查名额，
  避免两个管理员同时批准导致超额
end note

note over Bus, MsgRepo
  通知失败不回滚报名结果：异常由 EventBus 捕获
  并追加写入 instance/notification_failures.log
end note
@enduml
